+# PAM's success=N skips the next N modules: it skips the clamshell gate and
+# pam_fprintd, while the clamshell gate's success=1 goes on skipping exactly
+# pam_fprintd. polkit's stack, whose helper runs in no user session, gets no
+# remote gate. A rerun changes nothing, and a sudo stack from before the
